        "title": "Ok Operatörü",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148720,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Ok fonksiyonları</strong> oluşturmayı öğrenelim. Bunlar ES6 JavaScript standardının bir parçasıdır ve daha temiz ve kısa kod yazmak için kullanılır.</p><p>Aşağıdaki fonksiyonu yalnızca bir kod satırı kullanarak ok fonksiyonu olarak yeniden yazalım.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getPlayerSpawnMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spawnMessage = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ready!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPlayerSpawnMessage());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(spawnMessage());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const spawnMessage = () =&gt; \"Ready!\";</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148721,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow fonksiyonları, bir <strong>anonim</strong><strong>fonksiyon</strong> türüdür; yani fonksiyon adları yoktur.</p><p>Bu fonksiyonları çağırmak istiyorsak onları bir değişkenin içinde saklamamız ve sonunda parantezlerle değişkeni çağırmamız gerekir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"158\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getLevelTitle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelTitle = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tutorial Level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getLevelTitle());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelTitle());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const levelTitle</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>levelTitle()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148722,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ok fonksiyonlarıyla <code>function</code> anahtar kelimesine veya fonksiyon adına ihtiyacımız olmaz. Bu, başlangıçta kullandığımız ilk şeyin parantezler olduğu anlamına gelir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getLevelTitle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelTitle = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss Level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(</code>, ardından <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148723,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Normal fonksiyonlarda olduğu gibi, parantezlerin içine parametreler ekleyebilir ve ardından parametreleri fonksiyonun içinde kullanabiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"142\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"formatScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score for &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreLabel = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score for &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(scoreLabel(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>playerName</code>, ardından <code>playerName</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148724,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parantezlerden hemen sonra ve açılış süslü parantezinden önce ok operatörünü <code>=&gt;</code> ekleriz.</p><p>Bu operatörü, fonksiyonun yürütmesini istediğimiz kod bloğundan veya ifadeden hemen önce kullanırız.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHealthText = \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"myfunction\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Health: 100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHealthTextArrow = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Health: 100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getHealthText());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getHealthTextArrow());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=&gt;</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148725,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Geleneksel fonksiyonlarda olduğu gibi, bir arrow function'ın kod bloğunu kapsamak için süslü parantezleri <code>{}</code> kullanırız.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPlayerStatus = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hp = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + hp;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>};</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148726,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir ok fonksiyonunda yalnızca bir ifade varsa, oldukça kısa bir kod elde etmek için hem süslü parantezleri hem de <code>return</code> anahtar kelimesini yazmayabiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{ return &quot;Game Over&quot; }\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getGameOverText = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Game Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Game Over\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148727,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ok operatörünü <code>=&gt;</code> nereye ekleriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parantezlerden sonra ve açılan süslü parantezden önce</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>function</code> anahtar sözcüğünden sonra ve açılış küme ayracından <code>{</code> önce</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parantezlerden sonra ve açılan süslü parantezden önce.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148728,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir arrow function'da süslü parantezler <code>{}</code> ne işe yarar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kod bloğunu içerirler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir fonksiyonu çağırmak için kullanılırlar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kod bloğunu içerirler.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148729,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kodu nasıl kısaltabiliriz?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPauseText = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Küme parantezlerini <code>{}</code> ve <code>return</code> anahtar kelimesini kaldırarak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parantezleri <code>()</code> kaldırarak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Küme parantezlerini <code>{}</code> ve <code>return</code> anahtar kelimesini kaldırarak.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148730,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki arrow function'ı nasıl çağırırız?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHUDText = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: 20&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>getHUDText();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>getHUDText;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>getHUDText();</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148731,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ok fonksiyonunu tamamla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getEnemyCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getEnemyCount());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(</code>, ardından <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148732,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ok operatörünü kodla: <code>=&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getEnemyCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getEnemyCount());}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=&gt;</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148733,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>En kısa ok fonksiyonunu yazarak fonksiyonun <code>400</code> değerini döndürmesini sağla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getMaxScore = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getMaxScore());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>()</code>, ardından <code>=&gt;</code> ve son olarak <code>400</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148734,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ok fonksiyonunu çağır.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStartMessage = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Press Start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStartMessage());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>getStartMessage</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
